      "worked": "Replace $x$ by $-x$ and factor $-1$ from each factor:\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=(-x)(-x-1)(-x-2)\\\\y&=(-1)^3x(x+1)(x+2)\\\\y&=-x(x+1)(x+2)\\end{align*}$$\nThis is a reflection in the $y$-axis.",
